            "reviewBody": "Pretty darn good. I added a bunch of dark chocolate melts to the batter with mini choc chips. I didn't have green food color so I used green melts in the frosting along with Bailey's Irish Cream coffee creamer. My husband's office DEVOURED them.\nThanks for the recipe!",
